WEBVTT

00:02.100 --> 00:03.810
Everyone, let's do it!

00:42.850 --> 00:45.460
Aah! It's been too long!

00:45.460 --> 00:47.510
Humans! Real humans!

00:47.510 --> 00:50.040
Eh? I'm too close?

00:51.680 --> 00:53.010
That's unfriendly...

00:53.380 --> 00:55.330
I was so happy, too.

00:55.870 --> 00:58.240
I'm Hinako. Pleased to meet you.

00:58.740 --> 01:01.030
Umm... that expression...

01:01.030 --> 01:03.620
You feel like you have no idea what's going on?

01:04.000 --> 01:06.290
Um... how should I say this?

01:07.910 --> 01:10.760
From your perspective, I'm an anime character, right?

01:10.760 --> 01:15.420
I don't know why but I guess I've become an anime character, huh?

01:15.420 --> 01:18.470
Some time ago I was watching a really interesting anime, then...

01:18.470 --> 01:20.470
Without thinking, I screamed: "I want to go there!".

01:20.470 --> 01:22.480
I ended up in here.

01:22.480 --> 01:25.780
And that's how I ended up as character of an anime.

01:26.210 --> 01:29.590
Even now I have questions when I see myself in an anime.

01:30.980 --> 01:32.630
Um... that's a pretty placid reaction.

01:32.630 --> 01:34.450
Shouldn't you be more surprised?

01:35.040 --> 01:37.290
TL Note: Hinako says kouryuu, which can also mean to have intercourse.

01:35.040 --> 01:37.290
Let's do something together!

01:37.290 --> 01:39.170
A cooperation between anime and reality!

01:39.170 --> 01:40.810
What should we do?

01:41.530 --> 01:42.830
Let's play rock-paper-scissors!

01:43.220 --> 01:45.640
Rock, paper, scissors!

01:45.640 --> 01:50.220
Eh? Don't want to? So no rock-paper-scissors...

01:51.740 --> 01:54.830
Oh! Weight-training! Let's do some weight-training!

01:54.830 --> 01:57.160
Hmm... "Why weight-training?" you ask.

01:57.160 --> 01:58.810
This doesn't go outside...

01:59.950 --> 02:01.040
I've gotten fat.

02:02.700 --> 02:04.010
You don't have to see.

02:04.350 --> 02:08.020
Actually, this was sent to me yesterday.

02:08.020 --> 02:10.080
As a result,

02:10.880 --> 02:12.180
do it with me!

02:12.180 --> 02:13.040
Weight-training!

02:14.670 --> 02:18.950
It's just push-ups, sit-ups and squats, so it's nothing impossible.

02:19.590 --> 02:23.370
When it comes to things like this, it's important that you keep at it.

02:23.370 --> 02:29.510
Hmm? When I take a good look, aren't you a little chubby too?

02:30.220 --> 02:31.470
It's decided then!

02:31.470 --> 02:33.040
Hey, let's get ready...

02:33.430 --> 02:34.590
and start weight-training together!

02:34.590 --> 02:35.460
Let's start!

02:35.460 --> 02:37.920
Weight training

02:38.240 --> 02:42.820
I already said it earlier, we're starting with push-ups, sit-ups and squats.

02:43.220 --> 02:46.010
Let's do them in sets of twelve, okay?

02:46.010 --> 02:47.780
First, let's start with push-ups!

02:47.780 --> 02:49.680
Don't stick your butt up but don't let it fall down either!

02:50.440 --> 02:52.440
Let's try it once, okay!

02:52.680 --> 02:54.530
We do it like this.

02:54.530 --> 02:55.450
One

02:56.070 --> 02:57.910
