My body is starting to feel a little sore...

04:53.490 --> 04:57.070
It hasn't been long, doesn't it feel like we've done a lot?

04:57.070 --> 04:59.710
It might get dull, but if you keep at it you'll definitely get results!

05:00.570 --> 05:03.660
Actually, it's been a while since I've exercised...

05:04.010 --> 05:05.460
Aww, it really takes me back...

05:05.460 --> 05:06.400
Club activities...

05:06.400 --> 05:10.810
Ah, it's already time. I've got to get ready!

05:10.810 --> 05:12.480
It's almost my turn to appear in this anime.

05:12.480 --> 05:15.010
Right now I might look relaxed but I'm giving it my all, you know?

05:15.010 --> 05:18.730
So please continue with the weight training and harden your body!

05:19.640 --> 05:22.400
Come back tomorrow, okay?

05:23.960 --> 05:26.300
Yay! You have to! Okay?

05:26.300 --> 05:28.500
You absolutely must come back tomorrow, okay?

05:28.500 --> 05:30.720
Pinky promise~

05:30.720 --> 05:32.280
It's a promise!

05:32.640 --> 05:35.810
Thank you so much for today, see you tomorrow!

06:27.010 --> 06:29.800
Starring Hinako

06:32.520 --> 06:34.310
Training together!

06:41.080 --> 06:43.400
Aah! Wait a second!

06:46.140 --> 06:49.810
Hmph! All of a sudden, it really surprised me!

06:49.810 --> 06:54.790
But you really came back. I'm happy that you kept your promise.

06:55.200 --> 06:57.320
Then, let's work hard today too!

